@startuml
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram — Target Lesson Completion, XP, and Streak Update

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "Lesson Screen" as Screen
participant "Lesson Progress Service
(lib/api)" as ProgressApi
participant "Supabase Client" as Client
participant "Supabase RPC
record_lesson_progress" as Rpc
database "lessons" as Lessons
database "lesson_progress" as LessonProgress
database "daily_activity" as DailyActivity
participant "Dashboard / Progress Query" as Dashboard

note over Screen, ProgressApi
Target integration: recordLessonProgress already exists in lib/api;
the lesson UI should call it after the final activity is completed.
end note

Learner -> Screen: Submit final lesson activity
Screen -> Screen: Validate answer and calculate earned XP
Screen -> ProgressApi: recordLessonProgress(lessonId, "completed",
currentActivity, xpEarned, minutesPracticed)
ProgressApi -> Client: rpc("record_lesson_progress", parameters)
Client -> Rpc: Authenticated RPC request
Rpc -> Rpc: Resolve authenticated user from auth.uid()
Rpc -> Lessons: Validate lessonId
Lessons --> Rpc: Lesson exists
Rpc -> LessonProgress: Read previous status and earned XP
LessonProgress --> Rpc: Existing progress or none
Rpc -> Rpc: Calculate non-negative XP delta
and completion delta
Rpc -> LessonProgress: Upsert completed lesson progress
(increment attempt count)
Rpc -> DailyActivity: Upsert today's XP, completed lessons,
and practice minutes atomically

alt Lesson was not previously completed
  Rpc --> Client: Success; XP and completion count updated
else Lesson was already completed
  Rpc --> Client: Success; prevent duplicate XP/completion increment
end

Client --> ProgressApi: Success
ProgressApi --> Screen: Completion stored
Screen -> Dashboard: Refresh progress summary
Dashboard --> Screen: Updated XP and streak-related activity
Screen --> Learner: Display completion summary and earned XP

alt Validation or persistence fails
  Rpc --> Client: Error
  Client --> ProgressApi: Error
  ProgressApi --> Screen: Error
  Screen --> Learner: Preserve lesson state and show retry feedback
end
@enduml
